  "static_behavior_findings": {
    "unconscious": "PlayerCamera.HandleUnconsciousScreen: blackout, sleepFill radial image from energy (brain health when dying), consciousnessECG and text visible after black-time fade; no real recovery countdown claim.",
    "last_stand": "Body.TryLastStand is an original chance-based revival; PlayerCamera.LastStandSequence has a 6.7s intro, first 2s black, then 3 originals cycling at 8fps, original heartbeat+drone. Minecraft body model balance may differ and must not be claimed an exact port.",
    "bandage": "BandageMinigame angle-wrap actions at 20-degree intervals; original bandage sound after complete wrap.",
    "syringe": "SyringeMinigame drag, entry depth, position-dependent feed over time, fill consumption, excessive sideways movement failure.",
    "splint_and_tourniquet": "Item.cs original useLimbAction directly applies these items; no original minigame exists for these procedures. New requested minigames use original item sprites/sounds but are new Minecraft interactions.",
    "incremental_thought": "Talker.Update displays progressively at 18 characters/second, character-0 speech audio for changed alphanumeric characters. User requests this presentation in Minecraft actionbar."
  },
